msgid ""
"Same as the VMR-9 (renderless), but uses a true two-pass bicubic resizer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "IDC_DSNULL_COMP"
msgid ""
"Connects to any video-like media type and will send the incoming samples to "
"nowhere. Use it when you don't need the video display and want to save the "
"CPU from working unnecessarily."
msgstr ""

