msgctxt "IDS_D3DFS_WARNING"
msgid ""
"This option is designed to avoid tearing. However, it will also prevent MPC-HC from displaying the context menu and any dialog box during playback.\n"
"\n"
"Do you really want to activate this option?"
msgstr ""
